Output examples/demo/out/filter.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 500
Set FontSize 22
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "cat examples/inputs/clow_cards_en.txt | ./xylitol.sh filter --height=8"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "s"
Sleep 900ms
Type "h"
Sleep 1.4s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
